{"sha": "596bae1d77193eadc00612900b68b96e2d5661fa2684c56c1573fc27aaf6873e", "body": ["\\begin{example}[检验间隔定则]\\label{ex:b3:many-electron-atoms:lande-test}", "% ledger: lev:C.3P1, lev:C.3P2, lev:O.3P1, lev:O.3P0", "对于 ${}^3$P，该定则预言间隔之比为 $J = 2 : 1$，即 2。", "碳：$(43.4 - 16.4)/16.4 = 1.65$。氧（$2p^4$，倒置，\\termsym{3}{P}{2}", "最低，其次 $J = 1$ 位于 \\qty{158.3}{cm^{-1}}，$J = 0$ 位于 \\qty{227.0}{cm^{-1}}）：", "$158.3/68.7 = 2.30$。该定则在 20\\,\\% 以内成立：罗素–桑德斯耦合", "是对轻原子的良好描述，但并非精确描述。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw[omstate] (0,0) -- (1.6,0) node[midway, below] {$3s\\ {}^2$S$_{1/2}$};", "  \\draw[omstate] (0,3.0) -- (1.6,3.0);", "  \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.1,3.0) {$3p$};", "  \\draw[omstate] (2.8,2.75) -- (4.4,2.75) node[right] {${}^2$P$_{1/2}$};", "  \\draw[omstate] (2.8,3.25) -- (4.4,3.25) node[right] {${}^2$P$_{3/2}$};", "  \\draw[densely dotted, gray] (1.6,3.0) -- (2.8,2.75) (1.6,3.0) -- (2.8,3.25);", "  \\draw[omfluo] (3.3,2.73) -- (3.3,0.02) node[pos=0.55, left] {D$_1$};", "  \\draw[omfluo] (3.9,3.23) -- (3.9,0.02) node[pos=0.55, right] {D$_2$};", "  \\draw[omstate] (2.8,0) -- (4.4,0);", "  \\draw[densely dotted, gray] (1.6,0) -- (2.8,0);", "  \\draw[decorate, decoration={brace, amplitude=3pt}] (5.5,3.27) -- (5.5,2.73)", "     node[midway, right=3pt, align=left] {\\footnotesize \\qty{17.2}{cm^{-1}}\\\\[-1pt]\\footnotesize （未按比例）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 钠的 D 线。$3p$ 能级因自旋–轨道耦合", "而分裂为 ${}^2$P$_{1/2}$ 与 ${}^2$P$_{3/2}$；向基态 $3s$ 能级发射", "两条黄色谱线：D$_1$ 位于 \\qty{589.76}{nm}，D$_2$ 位于 \\qty{589.16}{nm}（真空", "波长）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[钠双线]\\label{ex:b3:many-electron-atoms:sodium}", "% ledger: lev:Na.3p1_2, lev:Na.3p3_2", "钠的 $3p$ 能级位于 16956.17 与 \\qty{16973.37}{cm^{-1}}：", "D 线的真空波长为 $10^7/16956.17 = \\qty{589.76}{nm}$ 与 \\qty{589.16}{nm}，", "二者相隔 \\qty{17.20}{cm^{-1}}。对于 ${}^2$P，$E(\\frac32) - E(\\frac12) =", "\\frac32A$，故 $A = \\qty{11.47}{cm^{-1}}$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[原子的选择定则]\\label{prop:b3:many-electron-atoms:selection-atoms}", "在罗素–桑德斯耦合中，电偶极跃迁要求", "$\\Delta S = 0$，$\\Delta L = 0, \\pm1$，$\\Delta J = 0, \\pm1$（但不包括 $J = 0 \\to J", "= 0$），且宇称改变：对于单电子跃迁，$\\Delta l = \\pm1$。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\begin{proof}[说明]", "$\\Delta S = 0$ 已在\\cref{ch:b3:electronic-spectroscopy}中证明：偶极", "算符不作用于自旋。其余结论由偶极算符的矢量性质", "得出，在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.62\\linewidth, height=6.2cm, xmin=-0.5, xmax=3.5,", "  ymin=158, ymax=173, axis y line=left, axis x line=none,", "  ylabel={能量 / $10^3$ cm$^{-1}$}, unbounded coords=jump, clip=false,", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omstate] table[x=x, y=E] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-atomic-levels-helium.dat};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:1.05,166.277) {$1s2s\\ {}^1$S};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:1.05,171.135) {$1s2p\\ {}^1$P};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:3.05,159.856) {$1s2s\\ {}^3$S};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:3.05,169.087) {$1s2p\\ {}^3$P};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=south] at (axis cs:0.5,172.3) {单重态};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=south] at (axis cs:2.5,172.3) {三重态};", "\\draw[omfluo] (axis cs:0.5,171.0) -- (axis cs:0.5,166.42) node[pos=0.5, left, font=\\scriptsize] {\\qty{2059}{nm}};", "\\draw[omfluo] (axis cs:2.5,168.95) -- (axis cs:2.5,160.0) node[pos=0.5, left, font=\\scriptsize] {\\qty{1083}{nm}};", "\\draw[densely dotted, gray] (axis cs:-0.3,159.856) -- (axis cs:2,159.856);", "\\draw[<->, omThm] (axis cs:-0.2,159.856) -- (axis cs:-0.2,166.277) node[pos=0.5, right, font=\\scriptsize] {$2K$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 两种“氦”。单重态与三重态能级，分属组态", "$1s2s$ 与 $1s2p$ 的能级，取其在基态以上的实测能量（", "${}^3$P 项取其各能级的平均值）。连线仅连接同一", "族的态；每个三重态均比其单重态低 $2K$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{history}[两种“氦”与不相容原理]", "氦于 1868 年因太阳而得名，1895 年在地球上由", "拉姆齐发现。其两个谱线系令光谱学家困惑了三十", "年。1925 年，泡利提出：任意两个电子的量子数不能全部相同，", "同年，乌伦贝克与", "古德斯密特提出了电子自旋；1926 年，海森堡证明", "仅凭波函数的对称性即可将氦分裂为单重态与", "三重态两族。", "\\end{history}", "", "\\begin{inthelab}[分辨钠双线]", "将钠灯置于光栅光谱仪的狭缝前。若用", "每毫米 600 条刻线的光栅，则两条谱线的一级衍射角", "相差约 \\num{0.02}\\textdegree：优质光谱仪能将二者分开，学生用的", "棱镜则不能。灯工作时温度很高，须待其", "冷却后方可操作。", "\\end{inthelab}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:many-electron-atoms:1}", "写出锂的基态 $1s^22s$ 的斯莱特行列式，其中", "$2s$ 电子的自旋为 $\\alpha$。为何", "$1s^3$ 没有对应的行列式？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:many-electron-atoms:2}", "计算组态 $p^2$、$p^3$ 与 $d^2$ 的行列式个数。", "$p^3$ 的谱项为 ${}^4$S、${}^2$D、${}^2$P，$d^2$ 的谱项为 ${}^3$F、${}^3$P、${}^1$G、", "${}^1$D、${}^1$S：请核对两者计数。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:many-electron-atoms:3}", "给出 N、O、F、\\ce{Ti^2+} 与 \\ce{Fe^3+}（$d^5$）的基态谱项与能级。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}